      "location": "sections/synthesis/30-themes.tex:19",
      "problem": "Compression produces a minor syntactic and verbal slip in summarizing 1 Corinthians 1:8-9: 'promising that Fidelis Deus (\"God is faithful\") will confirm them \"unto the end without crime\" into his Son's fellowship (1:8--9)' treats a complete clause ('God is faithful') as a noun-phrase subject and collapses v. 8 ('confirm you unto the end without crime') with v. 9 ('by whom you are called unto the fellowship of his Son') into 'confirm them ... into his Son's fellowship' (contrast the cleaner wording at 40-commentary.tex:25, 'faithful God (Fidelis Deus)').",
